header='''/*
 * Explicit-import finite integer range utilities. The canonical Range namespace is unchanged.
 * Signed ranks map MIN to zero and MAX to 2^width-1; all spans use u128.
 * Last ordinal is stored instead of count, so closed full-domain ranges stay representable.
 * Descriptor and cursor helpers do not allocate; collect_vector explicitly allocates output storage.
 * Materialization reports size/allocation errors; fixed-array Result storage is proportional to N.
 * No descriptor mutation, signed endpoint subtraction, or max-end increment is used.
 */
'''
